{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12101320","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12101320","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1210132001:0":{"text":"すみません、病人がいるんです。一晩泊めていただけませんか？","source_cn":"您好，我们有人身体不适，可以留宿一晚上吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B4F4A1642786E99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210132002:0":{"text":"金はあるんだろうな？","source_cn":"钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x428109EF4606321D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210132003:0":{"text":"うっ……海に落ちた時に巾着を落としてしまって……","source_cn":"呃，之前落水的时候，我们的钱袋都遗失了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF9FB041FC74B870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210132004:0":{"text":"うちは慈善事業じゃないんだ、あばら屋でも探して寝てな。","source_cn":"老子不搞慈善，出门找个窝棚睡去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4B853D752FE1C32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210132005:0":{"text":"まあ待てって！こいつらは俺の連れなんだ。","source_cn":"嘿，嘿，老兄！这是我带来的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3202A73F155C5AE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210132006:0":{"text":"ちょっとこっちに来て話そうぜ。","source_cn":"咱们借一步说话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84A588628A4C4B39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210132007:0":{"text":"またおめぇか、それで、こいつらは何なんだ？","source_cn":"又是你，说，这群人什么来头？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC67BCA16596CB3D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210132008:0":{"text":"海辺で拾ったんだ。これを見ろよ……","source_cn":"海边捡来的。你瞧这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC4715218981C9E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210132009:0":{"text":"……はっ、そう来たか！いいだろう。泊めてやるよ！","source_cn":"……行啊，你小子！这活老子接了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C08DD878B58263E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210132010:0":{"text":"んじゃ、<style=\"highlight\">こいつらをよろしく頼んだぜ</style>！","source_cn":"那就麻烦你，<style=highlight>好好照顾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F9D2FB13BBBC790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210132011:0":{"text":"ちょうど飯ができたとこだ、先に食え。","source_cn":"刚好厨房做好了饭，你们先吃吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC9F3B483F57F876","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210132012:0":{"text":"あら、お金はいらないんですか？","source_cn":"诶，不用给钱了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF966C901037DE9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1210132013:0":{"text":"俺もたまにはいいことをしてみたくなったのさ。善意はプライスレスって言うだろ？","source_cn":"老子难得发一回善心，善心无价，你能出多少？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46ECF208A878688","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1210132014:0":{"text":"ボルスとはちょっとした知り合いなんだ。安心して泊っていきな。","source_cn":"波尔斯和我有点交情，你们安心在这住着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC5CA6E72042E314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1210132015:1":{"text":"俺はもう行くから、ゆっくり飯でも食って来いよ。","source_cn":"那你们就吃着，我先走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDA0DADB40471B8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1210132016:1":{"text":"本当にありがとうございます、シンドバッドさん。","source_cn":"非常谢谢你，辛巴达。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D60696E39442E9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_t